      "description": "Uses position_near_with_facing because this is a find/locate task. The player must navigate near the jungle sign at spawn-relative (3, 0, 2) and face it to 'read' the directional text. max_distance=16 allows reading from a reasonable distance, and facing_tolerance=60 ensures the player is looking toward the sign.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "type": "position_near_with_facing",
          "params": {
