      "milestone_id": "craft_stone_sword",
      "description": "Uses inventory_has because crafting a stone sword (2 cobblestone + 1 stick on crafting table) places the result in the player's inventory. No stone sword exists in the scene initially, so its presence in inventory confirms successful crafting.",
      "rules": [
