      "milestone_id": "craft_cooked_rabbit",
      "description": "Uses inventory_has because smelting raw rabbit in the furnace with coal produces cooked_rabbit which the player picks up into inventory. No cooked rabbit exists in the scene initially (only raw rabbit in chest and on rabbits), so its presence confirms successful furnace smelting.",
      "rules": [
        {
